			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1621911">
									

<p>By that definition, when I shoot little Jimmy here, I haven't really killed him. His body is still right here, mostly intact even, and his soul is floating away somewhere off in that direction. Separate, but both still extant. No need for the handcuffs, officer. Gaffney and Drewbear can explain how Jimmy survived just fine.</p>
